WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.205
Ricky: Am I late? Am I late?

2
00:00:14.206 --> 00:00:20.477
Mr. Brown: Glad to see everyone is on time today.

3
00:00:20.478 --> 00:00:24.742
Brian: Ricky, I want to talk to you.

4
00:00:24.743 --> 00:00:27.081
Ricky: About what, Brian?

5
00:00:27.082 --> 00:00:40.207
Victor: Hi, Ricky! Ready to play

6
00:00:40.208 --> 00:00:42.769
baseball? Rachel: Can you see Ricky,

7
00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:50.082
Dad? Dad: No, I can’t. I wonder where he

8
00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:53.037
is. Where have you been?

9
00:00:53.038 --> 00:00:55.214
Ricky: Playing baseball.

10
00:00:55.215 --> 00:01:04.420
Dad: With Brian?

11
00:01:04.421 --> 00:01:08.852
Ricky: Hey, Brian, how’s your science project?

12
00:01:08.853 --> 00:01:11.642
Brian: Why do you care?

13
00:01:11.643 --> 00:01:14.747
Ricky: Because you’re my friend.

14
00:01:14.748 --> 00:01:16.736
Brian: I’m not your friend.

15
00:01:16.737 --> 00:01:23.877
Veronica’s brother is.

16
00:01:23.878 --> 00:01:27.499
Ricky: You’re just jealous because Victor is so cool.

17
00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:31.338
Brian: I’m not jealous because I don’t care.

18
00:01:31.339 --> 00:01:35.166
Ricky: Then maybe we shouldn’t be friends anymore.

19
00:01:35.167 --> 00:01:42.127
Brian: Fine by me!

